{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 20, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "To journey through the land of rising sun, a plan we must devise, a tale of travel and delight.\n\nFirst, let us set our feet upon the shores of Tokyo, where neon lights and ancient shrines embrace the night. There, in the heart of the city, let us roam the streets of Shibuya, where the bustling crowds and the iconic crossing shall witness our arrival.\n\nNext, we shall venture to the sacred mountain, Fuji, whose peak pierces the clouds, a sight to behold. Let us ascend its slopes, if the weather permits, and gaze upon its splendour from a distance, for the climb may be steep and the air thin.\n\nThence, to Kyoto we shall proceed, the former capital, where time seems to stand still. There, in the halls of the Kyoto International Manga Museum, let us immerse ourselves in the world of comics and storytelling, a treasure trove of culture and art.\n\nAfterwards, to the ancient capital of Nara, where deer roam free and the temples stand as testaments to a bygone era. In the serene gardens of Nara Park, let us feed the deer and wander through the halls of Todai-ji, the Great Buddha a sight to humble the soul.\n\nLastly, to Osaka we shall go, to partake in the culinary delights and the vibrant spirit of the city. There, in the bustling streets of Dotonbori, let us savour the food and the energy, a fitting end to our journey.\n\nAnd thus, our journey through Japan shall come to its close, a tale of beauty, culture, and unforgettable experiences, etched in our memories for eternity.", "logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -2.5619540214538574}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -2.4495158195495605}, {"token": " through", "logprob": -0.6960559487342834}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.3216543197631836}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -0.2680653929710388}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.008621730841696262}, {"token": " rising", "logprob": -0.17063072323